notes               = "One poem running across two printed pages: the dedication and the opening are on 150, the date on 151. The dedication برای دوستم اصغر محمدی ('for my friend Asghar Mohammadi') is printed in the outer margin, and the friend is then named inside the poem — an elegy. سیما in line 16 may be the woman's name Sima or the common noun 'face, countenance'; read as a name, flagged, not resolved. شب بو is night-scented stock. 3 Shahrivar = 25 August 1993. Imported as a draft with machine / lantern layers; ===translation=== left for Ben."
